# A program in the floppy's AUTO folder runs at boot (it waits for a key) after the cartridge's
# setup menu hands over ([E]xit), and TOS reaches the desktop. The disk comes
# from tools/dev/make_bench_disks.sh. A Mega STE's memory test is cut short
# with ESC.
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/disks/autotest.st
text "Atari +: (ST|STE|Mega STE), TOS" 1500
key e
key 0x1c
wait 100
key 0x01
screen same autotest 1500
key 0x39
desktop 2500
